# Keep the serverless bundle small without removing anything the runtime needs.
#
# EXCLUDED (regenerable, or local-only):
#   - the 44MB raw transaction extract and the built sqlite warehouse, both of
#     which the cold-start bootstrap regenerates into /tmp in ~2.5s
#   - local artefacts, tests, scratch/debug scripts, the Streamlit app
#   - the Next.js scaffold, kept in the repo for local work but excluded so
#     Vercel builds exactly one frontend
#
# INCLUDED (the runtime imports or reads these):
#   api/, backend/, config/, docs/corpus/, ontology/, sql/, public/,
#   scripts/__init__.py, scripts/generate_synthetic_data.py,
#   scripts/generate_corpus.py, data/gold/policies.json

.git
.github
.kilo
artifacts
node_modules
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
*.pyc
.venv
venv
.env
.env.*
README.md
DEPLOY.md

# local-only
tests
app
scripts/_smoke_*.py
scripts/run_pipeline.py
scripts/evaluate.py
scripts/verify_vercel.py

# regenerated at cold start
data/raw

# Next.js scaffold: excluded so Vercel builds only the static UI + function
package.json
package-lock.json
next.config.js
postcss.config.js
tailwind.config.js
pages
components
lib
deployment
